tools/analysis/vu_disasm.py decodes the PS2 VU1 instruction set. Its opcode
tables are the ISA's own opcode-to-mnemonic map under Sony's VU naming; the
PCSX2 emulator's VU disassembler (GPL-3.0, https://pcsx2.net) was consulted as
a cross-reference while building them. No PCSX2 source is included or adapted,
and the two differ where PCSX2 mislabels the accumulator SUBA group.
